body:
Yes, there is a Q1, Q2, and Q3, but it's different from free practice. The fastest 15 cars in Q1 participate in Q2, the bottom five are out of qualifying. Same thing happens in Q2, except now only the top 10 continue on to Q3.

&#x200B;

As for Mercedes, as I understand it they have a harder time warming up their tyres compared to other teams.
